{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BradleyGleavePortfolio/growth-project-backend/pulls/688","id":4729382822,"node_id":"PR_kwDORnQJEs8AAAABGeSnpg","html_url":"https://github.com/BradleyGleavePortfolio/growth-project-backend/pull/688","diff_url":"https://github.com/BradleyGleavePortfolio/growth-project-backend/pull/688.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/BradleyGleavePortfolio/growth-project-backend/pull/688.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BradleyGleavePortfolio/growth-project-backend/issues/688","number":688,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"feat(dunning): dunning v2 service (split D2 of #628)","user":{"login":"BradleyGleavePortfolio","id":264851314,"node_id":"U_kgDOD8lPcg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/264851314?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/BradleyGleavePortfolio","html_url":"https://github.com/BradleyGleavePortfolio","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BradleyGleavePortfolio/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BradleyGleavePortfolio/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BradleyGleavePortfolio/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BradleyGleavePortfolio/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BradleyGleavePortfolio/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BradleyGleavePortfolio/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BradleyGleavePortfolio/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BradleyGleavePortfolio/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BradleyGleavePortfolio/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"**Tier: T4 (money path).** Current head: `b17f514c` after FIX ROUND 2 (restack, merge-only, B-DUN-117). The stack lands as one: D1 -> D2 -> D3 -> D4 -> D5, deployed only after D5 together with mobile #322.\n\nSplit of #628 (dunning v2 live: card update, lockout, recovery; 12,334 lines at FIX ROUND 8 `dc47e0ef`, already current with main `d23fa317`) under the owner's PR size rule: over 3,000 changed lines is an automatic fail (MODEL_ROUTING.md 8.2, tgp-agent-context). Cut with an import-order check (no piece imports a later piece). Stack: D1 -> D2 -> D3 -> D4 -> D5, merged back to back; deploy only after D5, together with mobile #322. At split time the tree at D5 equalled #628's head (git diff); fix rounds change it from there. Behaviour notes for the owner from FIX ROUND 8 carry over: third-party-paid invoices settle one reconcile run later, and a dispute that arrives mid-cycle keeps the cycle open. No verdicts existed at dc47e0ef; each piece needs Opus 5.5 and Sol audits at its exact head (T4, money path). `tsc --noEmit` passes at every piece.\n\n**D2 (base D1, 2,926 lines after FIX ROUND 1):** dunning v2 service and legacy dunning hooks, with the service spec, the fix-round spec, and existing specs that import these files. FIX ROUND 1 moved the cadence and dispatcher to D1, where the D1 title already placed them.\n\n**Link change (Opus C-688-2):** the v1 dunning email `billing_portal_url` default changed from `https://thegrowthproject.app/billing` to `DUNNING_UPDATE_CARD_URL` (`https://app.trygrowthproject.com/billing/update-card`). The default is not flag-gated, and `BILLING_PORTAL_URL` is unset in production, so every v1 dunning email links to the card-update page. That page exists only from D4 (#690). This is one more reason the stack deploys only after D5.\n\n## Fix rounds\n| Round | Job | Head | Closed | Comment |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | B-D12-116 (agent 116) | `6718d211` | Sol B-688-1..B-688-5; Opus B-688-1, C-688-2, C-688-3, C-688-4, C-688-5 | [FIX ROUND 1](https://github.com/BradleyGleavePortfolio/growth-project-backend/pull/688#issuecomment-5976393847) |\n| 2 (restack, merge-only) | B-DUN-117 (agent 117) | `b17f514c` | none: merge of D1 `f8e47bf4`; D2 diff byte-identical (patch-id) | [FIX ROUND 2](https://github.com/BradleyGleavePortfolio/growth-project-backend/pull/688#issuecomment-5976851597) |\n","created_at":"2026-10-03T20:14:12Z","updated_at":"2026-10-04T05:15:38Z","closed_at":null,"merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"896be9a9b26458b5e7743b999e34d4b80d891390","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[{"id":11278565662,"node_id":"LA_kwDORnQJEs8AAAACoEFBHg","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BradleyGleavePortfolio/growth-project-backend/labels/size/size/XL","name":"size/size/XL","color":"ededed","default":false,"description":null,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":null,"draft":true,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BradleyGleavePortfolio/growth-project-backend/pulls/688/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BradleyGleavePortfolio/growth-project-backend/pulls/688/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BradleyGleavePortfolio/growth-project-backend/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BradleyGleavePortfolio/growth-project-backend/issues/688/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/BradleyGleavePortfolio/growth-project-backend/statuses/b17f514ccd8da195d18588ca4b7ca407a789f20e","head":{"label":"BradleyGleavePortfolio:agent115/dunning-split-2-dunning-service","ref":"agent115/dunning-split-2-dunning-service","sha":"b17f514ccd8da195d18588ca4b7ca407a789f20e","user":{"login":"BradleyGleavePortfolio","id":264851314,"node_id":"U_kgDOD8lPcg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/264851314?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/BradleyGleavePortfolio","html_url":"https://github.com/BradleyGleavePortfolio","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BradleyGleavePortfolio/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BradleyGleavePortfolio/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BradleyGleavePortfolio/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/user